   "id": "hook",
   "text": "Stuck under a thousand followers? Do these four things. The last one matters most.",
   "start": 0.35,
   "end": 5.714
  },
  {
   "id": "niche",
   "text": "One. Pick one niche, and stand out in it.",
   "start": 6.164,
   "end": 9.441
  },
  {
   "id": "hook2",
   "text": "Two. Hook them in the first second, or they scroll.",
   "start": 9.841,
   "end": 13.075
  },
  {
   "id": "daily",
   "text": "Three. Post every single day for thirty days.",
   "start": 13.475,
   "end": 17.118
  },
  {
   "id": "reply",
   "text": "Four. Reply to every comment in the first hour. That's what the algorithm notices.",
   "start": 17.518,
   "end": 23.106
  },
  {
   "id": "result",
   "text": "Do all four, and that first thousand comes fast.",
